  "name": "Tuna Teriyaki",
  "text": "Tuna Teriyaki\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nYield:\n\nIngredients\n\n1 tuna steak,\n\n120 ml teriyaki sauce.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Dry fry one side of the tuna in a non-stick frying pan over a medium heat until golden brown.\n\n2. Turn and add the teriyaki sauce, a little at a time, basting the steak.",
